// BMW M6 — "tyrant monkey"'s Blend Swap model (CC0, obj2pbrt-converted),
// distributed in pbrt-v4-scenes; the repo vendors the Blend Swap license
// note beside the scene (BLENDSWAP_LICENSE.txt). A white M6 coupe on a
// dark studio floor, lit by one equal-area sunflower-field sky — the
// showcase car-paint scene: smooth coated diffuse paint, aluminum trim,
// dielectric head/tail-light glass.
//
// Fetch:     scenes/corpus/fetch.sh bmw-m6   (pbrt-v4-scenes @ 30cf4a0)
// Bootstrap: cenote-cli import sources/pbrt-v4-scenes/bmw-m6/bmw-m6.pbrt
//            (re-imports go to scratch for diffing — this file is curated
//            by hand and is the source of truth)
// Oracle:    pbrt-v4 volpath maxdepth 8, halton (native header; compared
//            at 2048 spp — the scene ships asking for 65536). Native film
//            is plain "rgb" at iso 100, pbrt's default, so the native
//            render compares directly — no film-stripping needed.
//
// Import fidelity (7 warnings at bootstrap):
// - Eighth-res RMSE vs native pbrt: 0.077 raw / 0.029 display-clamped
//   (cenote 4096 spp vs pbrt 2048). The raw excess is uncorrelated
//   firefly energy on both sides — see the regularize note — not shading
//   bias, so raw is spike-dominated and unstable; clamped is the signal
//   (pbrt's own 512-vs-2048 clamped self-distance is 0.009). Clamped
//   residual = coat-Fresnel class (ajar/bathroom family) + the LEATHER
//   approximation + spectral-vs-RGB aluminum. Curating LEATHER is worth
//   2x: the defaults' 0.8-grey cabin scores 0.059 clamped.
// - The interior LEATHER is pbrt's `mix` material (unsupported): amount
//   0.2 with pbrt-v4 semantics (P(second) = amount) = 80% black diffuse
//   0.01 + 20% white coated 0.8. Curated below into one material — base
//   0.168, the white's coat at 0.2 weight — replacing the OpenPBR
//   defaults the importer emits. Approximation, not exact: pbrt picks one
//   constituent stochastically per shading point; unlock = mix material.
// - `regularize true` is dropped: pbrt tames the dielectric headlight
//   caustic spikes, cenote keeps its fireflies at equal spp. Convergence
//   class, not bias.
// - Both anisotropic-roughness warnings are equal-axis (carbonfibre,
//   floor) — averaging is exact, effectively clean.
// - Film "iso 100" dropped = pbrt's default, a no-op.
